      "observation": "16 of 21 slots stopped at the cumulative provider-token ceiling (400000) after a median of 23.5 tool calls and at most 139 s of a 14400 s wall ceiling; the tool-call ceiling (40) was never reachable because cumulative prompt tokens at the p95 context size require about 1273760 tokens.",
      "disposition": "final freeze sets the cumulative provider-token ceiling so that the tool-call ceiling is attainable at the p95 observed context size; the wall, step and tool-call ceilings are unchanged. This restores consistency between ceilings and is not a tuning of target, tolerance or conclusion rules."
    },
